# business-repos.conf — list of business-repo absolute paths to batch-onboard.
#
# Used by `bash scripts/init-business-repo.sh` when run from the central repo
# root (Mode A). One path per line; blank lines and `#`-prefixed comments are
# ignored. `~` and relative paths are expanded with `eval`.
#
# Copy this file to `business-repos.conf` (without the `.example` suffix) and
# fill in your own paths. The real `business-repos.conf` is .gitignored.

# Examples — replace with your own:
# ~/work/order-service
# ~/work/pricing-service
# /Users/me/code/inventory-service
